  "mirrorBoldQuotes": "[{\"text\":\"Livi is a very observant person, and he uses what he observes to be as kind and thoughtful as possible in his interactions with people, which allows him to connect with people deeper than most can!\",\"speaker\":\"Tilley\",\"role\":\"Friend\"},{\"text\":\"Livi exemplifies the traits I aim to inspire and cultivate in all individuals I work with: ravenous motivation to do high quality work that aligns with public good, while incorporating his unique sense of self, spirit, and lived experience throughout those efforts.\",\"speaker\":\"Bryn Loftness\",\"role\":\"Founder, NSF Graduate Research Fellow, and Mentor\"},{\"text\":\"Livi is a rare kind of person who’s always wanting to improve, whether its people skills, academics, or physical strength. He is also very willing to share what he’s learned throughout the improvement journey. He is very agentive, and genuinely wants to see other people succeed / is happy for you when you do. He is also unabashedly himself which is inspiring.\",\"speaker\":\"Garrett B.\",\"role\":\"Friend\"},{\"text\":\"You are a determined fellow who strives to make a difference in the world!\",\"speaker\":\"Rosie Rosebush\",\"role\":\"UVM Director of Student Success\"},{\"text\":\"Livi is a kind and thoughtful old soul in search of meaning. He is becoming an adult at odds with a generation more often interested in being entertained than educated. Livi is an intellectually curious renaissance man who desires making the most out of his time in life and relentlessly seeks opportunities to grow.\",\"speaker\":\"Chris Danforth\",\"role\":\"Director of the Vermont Advanced Computing Center\"},{\"text\":\"Not sure what to say except you have had quite a crazy adventure. Continue living your life to the fullest and keep going.\",\"speaker\":\"Wes\",\"role\":\"Teacher\"}]"
